  "details": "The game freezes for a couple of seconds while using this script. \nBasic understanding what it does:\nWhile the boolean is true it will loop true every transform object of the parent children. After the loop it done it should turn the while loop off. (The while loop only should fire once in this case. \nMy script need to run the while loop multiple times but for this example I only let it run once and this causes problems already.\nAt this moment the parent children are only 3 transform object (this shouldn't be a problem) But it freezes completely.",
